  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_9819.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La nit d&#39;aquest dissabte s&#39;han acabat ja, pr&agrave;cticament, les festes d&#39;Artesa, pedania d&#39;Onda, amb dos embolades, la primera a la pla&ccedil;a de baix i l&#39;altra, a la de dalt. B&eacute;, amb tres, perque primer es van embolar un &#39;bouero&#39; per a xiquets i xiquetes, tamb&eacute; baix. I com a esclat final, festa Pachanhouse.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimesemboladesfestesartesa13/img_9772.jpg\" alt=\"img_9772\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimesemboladesfestesartesa13/img_9773.jpg\" alt=\"img_9773\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimesemboladesfestesartesa13/img_9774.jpg\" alt=\"img_9774\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimesemboladesfestesartesa13/img_9775.jpg\" alt=\"img_9775\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimesemboladesfestesartesa13/img_9776.jpg\" alt=\"img_9776\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimesemboladesfestesartesa13/img_9777.jpg\" alt=\"img_9777\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimesemboladesfestesartesa13/img_9778.jpg\" alt=\"img_9778\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimesemboladesfestesartesa13/img_9779.jpg\" alt=\"img_9779\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.de